              "value": "Diligent Assault"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The hound archon carefully makes one greatsword Strike and one jaws Strike in any order. These attacks count toward the hound archon's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after all the attacks."
